# Skills are plain Markdown (plus a few small helper scripts and JSON/SVG
# assets) consumed by parsers and synced byte-for-byte into consumer repos
# (CCMAF skills-sync) — pin LF on every text file so Windows checkouts
# don't introduce CRLF into what consumers receive (a CRLF python3 shebang
# breaks direct execution on POSIX). Binary files are auto-detected.
* text=auto eol=lf
